WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.835
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:03.969
We hope you're doing well,
and now if you don't mind,

00:00:03.969 --> 00:00:05.338
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:08.808
West Virginia Senator
Joe Manchin announced yesterday

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:11.277
that he opposes
President Biden's nominee

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:13.512
for the Federal Reserve board,
before adding,

00:00:13.512 --> 00:00:15.615
"But out of curiosity,
who is it?"

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:17.650
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.753
The White House said yesterday
that national security adviser

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:23.489
Jake Sullivan had a 7-hour
conversation

00:00:23.489 --> 00:00:26.125
with a top Chinese
diplomat in Rome.

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.293
I hate to be the one
to tell you this,

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.795
but seven hours
is a breakup talk.

00:00:29.795 --> 00:00:33.399
No one -- no one's ever said,
"Well, my girlfriend and I

00:00:33.399 --> 00:00:35.368
were up talking all night,
and she loves the way

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.403
I load the dishwasher, and
everything is going great."

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:39.472
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:42.541
Tesla CEO Elon Musk yesterday
challenged Russian President

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:45.278
Vladimir Putin
to "single combat."

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:48.448
Oh, come on, give me
somebody to root for.

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:49.849
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:52.218
This is like hearing
the New York Yankees

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:53.753
want to play against Duke.

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:56.189
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:58.891
Iowa Senator Chuck Grassley
said recently

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:01.528
that Senate Republicans
will be fair and thorough

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:03.429
during the upcoming
confirmation hearings

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:06.366
for Supreme Court nominee
Ketanji Brown Jackson.

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:08.501
And added, "We're not going
to get in the gutter

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:09.769
like the Democrats did."

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:11.804
Though, to be fair,
they only got in the gutter

00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:13.739
because that's where
Brett Kavanaugh passed out,

00:01:13.739 --> 00:01:15.975
so...
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:19.445
Mayor Eric Adams joined the
social media platform

00:01:19.445 --> 00:01:23.415
TikTok yesterday
and said in his first video,

00:01:23.415 --> 00:01:27.920
"Bing bong, New York City,
your mayor is on TikTok.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:31.023
Let's get stuff done."
Okay.

00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:33.760
Being on TikTok is what we do

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.562
when we don't want
to get stuff done.

00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:38.297
That's like saying,
"We got a lot of work to do,

00:01:38.297 --> 00:01:40.066
somebody fire up Elden Ring."

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:42.168
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:44.804
That's right, Eric Adams
joined TikTok yesterday

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:47.706
and said in his first video,
"Bing bong, New York City."

00:01:47.706 --> 00:01:49.608
Oh, boy.

00:01:49.608 --> 00:01:52.345
If Eric Adams
was New York City's dad,

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:57.684
we'd be asking him to drop us
off two blocks away from school.

00:01:57.684 --> 00:01:58.985
"Your friends
will love bing bong."

00:01:58.985 --> 00:02:00.053
"Just, no!"

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:02.287
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.287 --> 00:02:06.125
According to a new study,
trained ants may be effective

00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:07.760
in detecting cancer in humans,

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:09.963
or at least more effective
than others.

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:11.463
It's cancer.

00:02:11.463 --> 00:02:13.766
Whatever you're typing in
right now, it's cancer.

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:15.335
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:17.803
Country legend Dolly Parton
announced yesterday

00:02:17.803 --> 00:02:20.206
that she will remove her name
from the Rock and Roll

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:21.441
Hall of Fame ballot.

00:02:21.441 --> 00:02:22.875
But Dolly is not
going to like this.

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:26.245
They're replacing her
on the ballot with Jolene.

00:02:26.245 --> 00:02:28.615
[ Audience groans ]

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.186
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.156 --> 00:02:38.824
Head writer Alex Baze and I had

00:02:38.824 --> 00:02:40.092
a conversation
right before this show.

00:02:40.092 --> 00:02:41.728
We had no idea how that joke
was going to go.

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:43.329
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:44.997
I will say, of the many ways
we thought,

00:02:44.997 --> 00:02:46.132
that wasn't one of them.

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:48.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.834 --> 00:02:51.570
And finally, in honor
of St. Patrick's day,

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:54.707
Krispy Kreme will release
four new flavors of doughnuts.

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:57.176
Though if you really want
to honor the Irish,

00:02:57.176 --> 00:02:59.512
I think you do no flavor.

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:01.280
[ Audience groans ]

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.483
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:07.086
I mean, to make a St. Patrick's
Day joke that's not about

00:03:07.086 --> 00:03:11.457
alcoholism
and is about bad cooking,

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:12.825
I think that shows
some real restraint.

00:03:12.825 --> 00:03:14.793
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.793 --> 00:03:16.462
That was the monologue,
everybody.

